{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>וְהָיָה בְךָ חֵטְא וְגוֹ׳.</b> That is, on the path of the statement of the Sages, of blessed memory (Shabbat 32a), that for the sin of vows a man's wife and children die — end quote. And this is the verse's saying <b>וְהָיָה בְךָ חֵטְא</b> in the sense of deficiency, for by means of delay of the vow there will be lacking from him his wife, who is like his own body, or his seed, which is also a part of him."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T19:18:45.923677464Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}